Package: ggChernoff
Title: Chernoff Faces for 'ggplot2'
Version: 0.3.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("David", "Selby", , "selby@cs.uni-kl.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a Chernoff face geom for 'ggplot2'. Maps
    multivariate data to human-like faces. Inspired by Chernoff (1973)
    <doi:10.1080/01621459.1973.10482434>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/Selbosh/ggChernoff
BugReports: https://github.com/Selbosh/ggChernoff/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    ggplot2 (>= 4.0.0),
    grid,
    rlang,
    scales
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
Encoding: UTF-8
